This package is a renamespaced, self-contained redistribution of the Qwen3.6-35B-A3B
tt-nn model from the tt-metal repository (models/demos/qwen3_6_a3b), together with two
verbatim shims from tt-metal models/common:

  ttrunner_qwen36/_vendor/lightweightmodule.py  <- models/common/lightweightmodule.py
  ttrunner_qwen36/_vendor/moe_gather.py         <- models/common/moe_gather.py

These vendored files are unmodified except for import renamespacing. All are governed by
the tt-metal Apache-2.0 license.

The platform runtimes `ttnn` and `ttl` (tt-lang) are NOT included; they are provided by
the serving environment and must be co-versioned with the tt-metal build used to compile
the bundled kernel cache.
